---
title: Garibaldi
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, aperitivo]
source: Classic cocktail, number 41 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

Blend or whisk @orange juice{4%fl_oz}(freshly squeezed) for ~{10%seconds} until it is light and frothy. Fill a #highball glass{} with ice, pour in @Campari{1.5%fl_oz}, and top with the orange juice. Garnish with an @orange{1%wedge}.

> The airy, "fluffy" juice is the point; carton juice won't froth.
